      "content": "i just feel like everything is a zero sum game. like, if you look at the math of it, all the effort to exist just cancels out the suffering. life isn't actually \"good,\" it's just a series of transactions that eventually end in nothing anyway. so why does everyone act like staying alive is the only logical choice?",
